package com.sliverzfx.gothicquest
object Gothic2Chapter3Data { val quests = listOf(
g2later("G2G-C03-015",3,1,"Remedy for Hilda","Side Quest","Lobart’s Farm","General","Stage 1 — Return from the Valley and secure the Eye of Innos","Get medicine for Hilda after the Seekers pass through the farm.","Speak to Lobart/Hilda in Chapter 3. Obtain the requested healing remedy from the appropriate alchemist/healer and deliver it to Hilda.","Do it promptly while visiting the farm for Seeker-related quests."),
g2later("G2G-C03-004",3,2,"Bennet's in Prison","Main Quest","Khorinis / Onar’s Farm","Main / Faction","Stage 1 — Return from the Valley and secure the Eye of Innos","Clear Bennet of Lothar’s murder.","Learn that Bennet has been jailed. Investigate Lothar’s murder in the Upper Quarter, question witnesses and obtain the key evidence implicating Cornelius. Recover Cornelius’s diary/confession, give it to Lord Hagen and free Bennet.","Required because Bennet must repair the broken Eye of Innos."),
g2later("G2G-C03-006",3,3,"Diego's Gold","Side Quest","Valley of Mines / Khorinis","General","Stage 1 — Return from the Valley and secure the Eye of Innos","Recover Diego’s hidden bag of gold.","Speak to Diego in Khorinis after Chapter 2. Return to the Valley of Mines location he describes (near his old escape route/meeting point), recover the gold bag and bring it to him.","Can be combined with any return trip to the Valley."),
g2later("G2G-C03-005",3,4,"Diego's Business","Side Quest","Khorinis","General","Stage 1 — Return from the Valley and secure the Eye of Innos","Deliver Diego’s business message to Gerbrandt and settle the old score.","After Diego’s Gold, take Diego’s letter/message to Gerbrandt in the Upper Quarter. Deliver it, handle Gerbrandt’s reaction and return to Diego.","Opens Diego’s comfortable return to Khorinis and a useful reward."),
g2later("G2G-C03-009",3,5,"Gone Missing","Side Quest","Khorinis countryside","General","Stage 1 — Return from the Valley and secure the Eye of Innos","Investigate the old map/papers Hanna found and locate the missing person/treasure lead.","Speak to Hanna at the Sleeping Moneybag. Follow the clues in the documents to the indicated countryside location, investigate what happened and return with the result.","A later exploration quest; read every note you receive."),
g2later("G2G-C03-010",3,6,"Moonshine","Side Quest","Akil’s Farm","General","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Expose the secret moonshine still run near Akil’s farm.","Play Ehnim and Egill against one another by passing their insults/information back and forth until one reveals the still. Find the hidden distillery, resolve the situation, and report to the appropriate NPC.","Dialogue order matters; exhaust both brothers’ options."),
g2later("G2G-C03-018",3,7,"Sheep Thieves","Side Quest","Akil’s Farm","General","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Find and stop the thieves stealing Akil’s sheep.","Speak to Akil about the missing animals. Follow tracks/clues into the nearby forest/cave, confront the thieves, recover or account for the sheep, then return to Akil.","Chapter 3 farm side quest."),
g2later("G2G-C03-022",3,8,"The Displaced Farmer","Side Quest","Sekob’s Farm","General","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Drive the Seekers out of Sekob’s farm.","Find Sekob displaced from his house. Enter the farmstead, defeat the Seekers occupying it, search for relevant documents/loot, then tell Sekob it is safe.","Be prepared for strong magic attacks."),
g2later("G2G-C03-003",3,9,"Alone and Defenseless","Side Quest","Bengar’s Farm","General","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Help Bengar after his workers abandon the farm.","Visit Bengar in Chapter 3 and learn he is alone. Recruit/convince suitable people to return or provide protection, resolve the threats that caused the exodus, and report back.","Check connected farm NPCs before advancing chapters so nobody becomes unavailable."),
g2later("G2G-C03-026",3,10,"Torlof's Fear of the Black Man","Side Quest","Onar’s Farm","Mercenaries / General","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Remove the Seekers frightening Torlof and the farm.","Speak to Torlof in Chapter 3. Hunt down the Seekers he identifies around Onar’s farm/nearby roads, kill them and report back.","A good early Chapter 3 cleanup quest."),
g2later("G2G-C03-017",3,11,"Shadowbeast Horns for Buster","Side Quest","Onar’s Farm","Mercenaries","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Collect shadowbeast horns for Buster.","As a mercenary/Dragon Hunter, speak to Buster. Learn horn removal if needed, hunt shadowbeasts and sell/deliver their horns to him as you collect them.","Repeatable-style collection quest; check payout before selling horns elsewhere."),
g2later("G2G-C03-023",3,12,"The Judge's Lackey","Side Quest","Khorinis / Monastery countryside","Mercenaries","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Obtain evidence Lee can use against the Judge.","Accept Lee’s order and approach the Judge in the Upper Quarter. Gain his trust by doing the jobs he assigns, including retrieving the sacred hammer/handling Morgahard, then turn the resulting evidence or confession over to Lee.","Long mercenary-only chain. Avoid permanently losing the sacred hammer needed by monastery content."),
g2later("G2G-C03-007",3,13,"Documents","Side Quest","Monastery of Fire","General","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Recover Babo’s missing documents.","Speak to Babo. Follow the trail through the monastery and the person who took/holds the papers, recover them and return them to Babo.","A later follow-up to Babo’s Chapter 1 errands."),
g2later("G2G-C03-008",3,14,"Forged Mine Shares","Side Quest","Khorinis / Monastery","Mage","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Collect the forged mine shares circulating among merchants.","Take Serpentes’s assignment. Visit the named merchants/citizens, buy or otherwise acquire each forged share, identify the source and return the complete set/evidence to Serpentes.","Mage-specific and expensive if you simply buy every share; save before negotiating."),
g2later("G2G-C03-011",3,15,"Power of the Stars","Side Quest","Monastery of Fire","Mage","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Bring Hyglas the book The Divine Power of the Stars.","Speak to Hyglas. Buy or find the requested book—city book traders such as Zuris/Constantino’s circle can point you toward it—then return it to Hyglas.","Mage-side reading quest."),
g2later("G2G-C03-021",3,16,"The Desecrated Shrines","Side Quest","Khorinis countryside","Paladin","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Cleanse the Innos shrines corrupted by Seekers.","As a Paladin, receive holy water from Ulthar. Visit all seven desecrated roadside Innos shrines, use holy water at each, then return to Ulthar.","Faction-specific Chapter 3 quest; track each shrine to avoid missing one."),
g2later("G2G-C03-025",3,17,"The Seekers","Side Quest","Khorinis / Valley / Irdorath","Mage","Stage 2 — Farms, Seekers and faction follow-ups","Investigate and defeat the Seekers and their possession magic.","As a Fire Mage, follow Xardas/Pyrokar’s instructions to identify possessed people and Seeker leaders, collect the required evidence/objects across Chapters 3–6, and use the protective amulet when needed. Report progress at each stage.","Long mage-exclusive quest spanning several chapters."),
g2later("G2G-C03-001",3,18,"A Bandit Armor","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Pirate Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 3 — Jharkendar finale","Obtain a bandit disguise for infiltrating Raven’s camp.","Work with Greg and the pirates. Gain access to Greg’s hut by resolving Francis’s key/debt-book situation, complete the tasks Greg requires, then receive the medium bandit armor from Bones/Greg.","Wear the armor before approaching the bandit camp; many bandits attack on sight otherwise."),
g2later("G2G-C03-013",3,19,"Raven's Slaves","Main Quest","Jharkendar – Gold Mine","Night of the Raven – Main","Stage 3 — Jharkendar finale","Free the citizens kidnapped from Khorinis and forced to mine gold.","Reach the bandit camp and enter the gold mine. Speak to Patrick and the other slaves, deal with the guards/foreman and arrange their escape after Raven’s control is broken. Return to the Water Mage/Ring contacts and later to people in Khorinis who asked about the missing.","Completes the practical rescue side of the missing-people storyline."),
g2later("G2G-C03-014",3,20,"Relics","Side Quest","Jharkendar","Night of the Raven","Stage 3 — Jharkendar finale","Bring Saturas all five colored tablets from the Builders’ mansions.","Explore the five mansions and collect the yellow, purple, blue, green and red tablets. The red tablet is tied to the bandit-camp/Esteban-Bloodwyn chain rather than simply sitting in an easy chest. Deliver the relics to Saturas; he later returns them when you need the temple clues.","Keep the tablets until the Water Mages have studied them."),
g2later("G2G-C03-002",3,21,"Access to the Temple","Side Quest","Jharkendar – Bandit Camp","Night of the Raven","Stage 3 — Jharkendar finale","Get past Raven’s temple guard by eliminating Bloodwyn.","Ask the temple guard how to enter. Go to the gold mine and speak to Garaz; clear the minecrawler grotto so Bloodwyn comes to inspect it. Defeat Bloodwyn, take his head and chest key, then show the head to the temple guard.","Optional dialogue can weaken Bloodwyn before the fight."),
g2later("G2G-C03-024",3,22,"The Power of the Guardians of the Dead","Main Quest","Jharkendar","Night of the Raven – Main","Stage 3 — Jharkendar finale","Summon Quarhodron and obtain the tablet that opens the sealed Temple of Adanos.","Get the summoning scroll from Myxir and use it at Quarhodron’s tomb. Answer his questions: Guardians of the Dead; Warrior Caste; Priests; Warrior Caste; Scholars; Healers; “I cannot possibly know that.” Receive Quarhodron’s tablet and report to Myxir/Saturas.","Wrong answers can be retried without permanent penalty."),
g2later("G2G-C03-019",3,23,"The Chambers of the Temple","Main Quest","Jharkendar – Temple of Adanos","Night of the Raven – Main","Stage 3 — Jharkendar finale","Survive the ancient temple traps and reach Raven.","At the first switch wall press far left, far right, then middle. In the five-corridor chamber take the outer-right passage. In the dark floor chamber use light/torch to follow the solid stone plates, then take the right exit. In the final lever room stand in the center and let Rhademes operate the correct mechanism; carrying the Green Tablet makes him choose correctly immediately. Continue to Raven.","Wrong switches/paths trigger lethal spikes. Save before each chamber."),
g2later("G2G-C03-012",3,24,"Raven","Main Quest","Jharkendar","Night of the Raven – Main","Stage 3 — Jharkendar finale","Stop Raven and take the Claw of Beliar before he escapes the Temple of Adanos.","Infiltrate the bandit camp in bandit armor and gather information from Fortuno. Gain temple access by killing Bloodwyn. Report Raven’s movements to Saturas, summon Quarhodron and obtain the temple-opening tablet, navigate the Chambers of the Temple, defeat Raven and loot the Claw of Beliar. Report to Saturas and Greg.","One of the main add-on quests. The exact game chapter depends on when you tackle Jharkendar; this guide preserves the 202-entry reference grouping."),
g2later("G2G-C03-020",3,25,"The Claw of Beliar","Side Quest","Jharkendar / Beliar shrines","Night of the Raven","Stage 3 — Jharkendar finale","Decide what to do with Raven’s divine weapon.","Loot the Claw from Raven. Show it to Saturas (and optionally Xardas for extra dialogue). Choose whether to surrender/destroy it or keep it and use Beliar shrines to attune/upgrade it; mages receive Beliar runes instead of the melee version.","Major build-defining choice; sacrificing the Claw permanently removes it."),
g2later("G2G-C03-016",3,26,"Replacement for Vatras","Main Quest","Jharkendar / Khorinis","Night of the Raven – Main","Stage 3 — Jharkendar finale","Arrange for another Water Mage to take Vatras’s place in Khorinis.","Defeat Raven and report to Saturas. Saturas agrees to send Myxir to Khorinis. Return to Vatras and confirm he now has a replacement so he can join the Eye of Innos restoration ritual.","Required to finish the Eye of Innos in Night of the Raven.")
)}